<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S5.T4.fig2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 4</span>: </span><span id="S5.T4.fig2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">{SDXL, LCM-SDXL} and Koala-700m on 5k MJHQ dataset. <math id="S5.T4.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangle t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">△</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangle t</annotation></semantics></math> denotes timestep shift.</span></figcaption>
<div id="S5.T4.fig2.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:219.2pt;height:114pt;vertical-align:-55.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-42.6pt,22.2pt) scale(0.7,0.7) ;">
<table id="S5.T4.fig2.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
